    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under Sub Section (4)d of Section 66 of Local Government Institutes Election Ordinanceamended by Local Government Institutes Election (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012, I, J. M. R. P. Jayasinghe theCommissioner of Local Government in the North Western Province, hereby notify that the meeting for the purpose ofelecting Chairman/Vice Chairman for the Urban Council Chilaw will be convened at the conference hall of Urban CouncilChilaw at 9.30 a. m. on 09.04.2018.",
